 gray:"เด็ก jaundice, pale stool, U/S absent gallbladder, fibrosis around portal vein ถาม pathogenesis — A. NOTCH อะไรสักอย่าง B. Chronic inflammation and fibrotic cholangiopathy C. Pancreaticobiliary malformation with biliary stenosis",
